<title>USA: Medallion Financial increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>Medallion Financial increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medallion Financial Corp said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.22 per share from $0.21 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable May 21 to shareholders of record on May 8.</p>
</text>
